{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
A nearby actor forcefully|normally|gently leashes {{speakingNpc.name}}'s neck|waist with a tight|short|middle|long chain|rope|magic leash. Subject puts the collar on; holder may be that same actor or None to leave the leash hanging from the named body part. Available actors (subject): {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Holder: that actor or None. Never pick {{speakingNpc.name}} as holder. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
